@node 030
@section 0.3.0

This release improves Codex terminal robustness in Emacs.  Programmatic @samp{eat}
submissions now send prompt text literally, live-instance selection ignores
stale Codex-named buffers whose terminal process has exited, transcript lookup
results are cached by session id, and retained terminal output is protected
across redraw and escape-sequence edge cases.

